<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-zhang-sorting-morphogenesis-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Zhang, Goldstein & Levin (2025) Autonomous Cell-View Sorting Morphogenesis, 3-Ablation Platonic Space Audit & Hoel Causal Emergence 2.0 — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Four-language bit-exact replication and formal Lean 4 verification of Zhang, Goldstein & Levin (2025), paired with a 3-ablation mechanistic evaluation of Levin's (2025/2026) Latent Platonic Space claims and Erik Hoel's (2013, 2026) Causal Emergence 1.0 & 2.0 on S_3..S_6. Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 93.6, reproducibility 94.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 967dc2c3; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 96, Code-to-model traceability 95, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/zhang_goldstein_levin_kymograph_validation.png: rendered output of sorting-morphogenesis/validate_kymograph_and_paper.py, not present when the audit was snapshotted (unfingerprinted). Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Zhang, Goldstein & Levin (2025) report decentralized cell-view efficiency, frozen-cell error tolerance, Delayed Gratification (DG > 0 on E(v)), and chimeric algotype clustering on unique (Fig. 8A) and duplicate (Fig. 8D) keys | Levin (2025/2026, Ingressing Minds Sec. 6.3 & Fig. 14) claims no error-handling code was added for broken cells, Delayed Gratification goes against the sorting gradient to bypass barriers, and algotype clustering is an unprogrammed side-quest not explained or produced by the medium; reconstructed_in_script: Bit-exact 4-language ports (Python 3, C++20, Node.js, Lean 4) reproducing 14/14 paper benchmarks with 0 cell mismatches, plus 3 code ablations and exact S_3..S_6 Markov TPM Causal Emergence 1.0 & 2.0 analysis; transfer_boundary: Proves that InsertionSortCell.py (L74-76) contains an explicit `if status == FREEZE: prev = -1` reset (4.5x error jump when ablated), Bubble/Insertion move 0 cells across an immovable barrier and descend strictly by Delta I = -1 on the Coxeter inversion potential I(v) (Hoel CE 2.0 = +0.1191 vs -0.2525 on E(v)), and C=2 duplicate keys produce Anti-Clustering (0.477 < 0.50, S B | S B); does_not_claim: Demonstrates that while Weak Structural Platonism (mathematical free lunches of S_n and kinematic speed waves) is justified, Strong Dualist Ingression P_dualist adds 0.00 differential predictions beyond the local Markov transition matrix D." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

